      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "\n## NoobAI XL V-Pred 1.0 - text to image\n\nSDXL (Illustrious/NoobAI) finetune trained on full Danbooru + e621 tags.\nThis is a **v-prediction (zsnr)** checkpoint and does NOT behave like eps models.\n\n- **V-prediction**: node `ModelSamplingDiscrete` sets `v_prediction` + `zsnr`\n  (recent ComfyUI auto-detects this too). Other samplers can oversaturate.\n- Sampling: **Euler** + `normal` scheduler.\n- CFG **4-5**, steps **28-35**, total area ~1024x1024 (best: 832x1216,\n  1024x1024, 1216x832, 1344x768, ...).\n- **CLIP skip -2**.\n- Prompt template (built into the positive node):\n  `masterpiece, best quality, newest, absurdres, highres, safe, <tags>`.\n  Tag order: `<count>, <character>, <series>, <artists>, <general tags>`.\n- A negative prompt is recommended (see the negative node).\n- Optional 4x upscale: `generate_image.py --upscale` (4x-UltraSharp); the\n  upscale nodes below are bypassed unless enabled.\n\n**models**\n\n- [NoobAI-XL-Vpred-v1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Laxhar/noobai-XL-Vpred-1.0/resolve/main/NoobAI-XL-Vpred-v1.0.safetensors)\n- [4x-UltraSharp.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kim2091/UltraSharp/resolve/main/4x-UltraSharp.safetensors) (optional upscaler)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 models/\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 checkpoints/\n    \u2502      \u2514\u2500\u2500 NoobAI-XL-Vpred-v1.0.safetensors\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 upscale_models/\n           \u2514\u2500\u2500 4x-UltraSharp.safetensors\n```\n\nDriven by `generate_image.py --workflow noobai_xl_vpred` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "\n## NoobAI XL V-Pred 1.0 - text to image\n\nSDXL (Illustrious/NoobAI) finetune trained on full Danbooru + e621 tags.\nThis is a **v-prediction (zsnr)** checkpoint and does NOT behave like eps models.\n\n- **V-prediction**: node `ModelSamplingDiscrete` sets `v_prediction` + `zsnr`\n  (recent ComfyUI auto-detects this too). Other samplers can oversaturate.\n- Sampling: **Euler** + `normal` scheduler.\n- CFG **4-5**, steps **28-35**, total area ~1024x1024 (best: 832x1216,\n  1024x1024, 1216x832, 1344x768, ...).\n- **CLIP skip -2**.\n- Prompt template (built into the positive node):\n  `masterpiece, best quality, newest, absurdres, highres, safe, <tags>`.\n  Tag order: `<count>, <character>, <series>, <artists>, <general tags>`.\n- A negative prompt is recommended (see the negative node).\n- Optional 4x upscale: `generate_image.py --upscale` (4x-UltraSharp); the\n  upscale nodes below are bypassed unless enabled.\n\n**models**\n\n- [NoobAI-XL-Vpred-v1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Laxhar/noobai-XL-Vpred-1.0/resolve/main/NoobAI-XL-Vpred-v1.0.safetensors)\n- [4x-UltraSharp.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kim2091/UltraSharp/resolve/main/4x-UltraSharp.safetensors) (optional upscaler)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 models/\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 checkpoints/\n    \u2502      \u2514\u2500\u2500 NoobAI-XL-Vpred-v1.0.safetensors\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 upscale_models/\n           \u2514\u2500\u2500 4x-UltraSharp.safetensors\n```\n\nDriven by `generate_image.py --workflow noobai_xl_vpred` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
